    - target: {fileID: 3620617087746342366, guid: 349f2c1b94a0b9341a4c306e7ac0c756, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_text
      value: "Jan Visscher Cornelissen (often listed as Jan Visscher Cornelisen)
        was an ensign (vaandrig) in the Dutch civic guard, most famous for his inclusion
        in Rembrandt van Rijn\u2019s 1642 masterpiece, The Night Watch.\nHe is carrying
        the compagnie'sflag in orange, white, and blue, the colours of the Dutch
        Prince of Orange and the Republic, which were standard for Dutch civic guard
        banners of the era. "
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
