    - target: {fileID: 3620617087746342366, guid: 349f2c1b94a0b9341a4c306e7ac0c756, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_text
      value: 'One of the most unusual features of the painting is the mysterious
        girl who emerges from the center of the painting.

        Dressed in gold
        and with flowing blond hair, she carries a chicken tied to her waistband.
        The bird is the clue to the puzzle, as a golden claw was used as an emblem
        for the musketeers at this time.

        So, the girl probably personifies
        the whole company in the painting.'
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
